  "biography": {
    "plain_text": "Scott Storch is an American record producer who began as a keyboard player with the Roots. He moved into studio production, writing and producing hits for Beyoncé and 50 Cent. Melodies became his musical signature, while fees and royalties generated substantial earnings during the most commercially successful years of his recording career.",
